  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato (unpeeled) into 1cm chunks. Cut capsicum into 2cm chunks.\n• Place sweet potato and capsicum on the lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5ff52a8a9a978061f366cebf/step-33253fdc.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a medium saucepan, bring the water (for the rice) to the boil.\n• Add basmati rice and a pinch of salt, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low. Cook for 10 mins, then remove pan from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5ff52a8a9a978061f366cebf/step-c0335468.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. Roughly chop Asian greens. Slice lime (see ingredients) into wedges.\n• Heat a drizzle of oil in a frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook garlic and curry paste (see ingredients) until fragrant, 1 min. Add vegetable stock (1 cube for 2P / 2 cubes for 4P), soy sauce, coconut cream, brown sugar and water (for the curry) and simmer until thickened, 4 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5ff52a8a9a978061f366cebf/step-ff572f7d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add Asian greens to curry and stir until wilted, 1-2 mins.Stir in roast veggies. Remove from heat and add a generous squeeze of lime. Season to taste.\n• Divide rice and veggie curry between bowls. Sprinkle with peanuts. Serve with any remaining lime wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5ff52a8a9a978061f366cebf/step-372e84d4.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
